      "observed": "The FCC1 VCAP pins are assigned to UART3_TX_FCC and UART3_RX_FCC; NAVC1 VCAP_1 and VCAP_2 are assigned to I2C3_SDA_NAVC and UART3_TX_NAVC. No dedicated VCAP capacitors are shown at these pins.",
