        },
        {
          "source": "schematic",
          "quote": "VCAP_1 I2C3_SDA_NAVC; VCAP_2 UART3_TX_NAVC; UART3 -> Debug (via USB) (Navigation Computer, page 3)"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "USB-UART bridges (programming/debug) | otter_CH330 ×2"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The VCAP regulator outputs are loaded or driven by external signal circuitry instead of being correctly decoupled, which can prevent the MCUs from operating reliably. The assigned UART/I2C signals will also not function as intended on VCAP pins.",
      "confidence": 0.99
